@startuml 004-sequence-question
title F5/F8 時序圖：開放題目 → 即時監控 → 時間到／手動結束 → 直接開放下一題／重新開放
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF7F0
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F0E6
  ParticipantBorderColor #1F3A93
  ArrowColor #1F3A93
  LifeLineBorderColor #1F3A93
}
autonumber

actor "老師" as T
participant "ActivityControlPage\n+ useTeacherActivity" as TC
participant "ActivityRoutes" as AR
participant "ActivityService" as AS
participant "ActivityStateMachine" as FSM
participant "SubmissionService" as SS
participant "ResultService" as RS
participant "MonitorViewBuilder" as MB
participant "SocketServer" as SK
participant "StudentPage" as SC
actor "B 組代表" as S
database "Repository" as DB

== 開放題目 ==
T -> TC : 點選第 1 題、秒數 60、按「開始搶答」
TC -> AR : POST /teacher/activity/open {questionId, seconds}
AR -> AR : RequireAuth + RequireRole(TEACHER)
AR -> AS : openQuestion(teacher, Q1, 60)
AS -> FSM : open(Q1, 60)
FSM -> FSM : ActivityRules.validateSeconds（5–600 整數）
FSM -> FSM : 確認 phase=WAITING 或 CLOSED、Q1 為 NOT_OPENED
FSM -> AS : onQuestionOpened hook
AS -> SS : startQuestion(Q1, round=1, parts)
AS -> DB : 記錄本輪參與組別（開放當下有成員的組）
FSM -> DB : 儲存 ANSWERING、openedAt、endsAt
FSM -> FSM : setTimeout(60s)
FSM -> SK : onChange
SK -> MB : build()（老師視角）
SK --> TC : teacher:update {phase=ANSWERING, endsAt, monitor 0/4}
SK --> SC : state:update（學生視角，不含他組資料）
AS -> DB : ActivityEvent(QUESTION_OPENED, 60)
AR --> TC : 200 TeacherActivityView

== 即時監控 ==
S -> SC : 填寫（1）（2）小題並送出
SC -> SS : POST /student/submissions {Q1, answers[]}（StudentRoutes）
SS -> SS : validatePartAnswers（每小題 1–500 字）
SS -> SS : 同步寫入記憶體 Map(B 組, rank=1, receivedAt, answers[])
SS --> SK : StudentRoutes：pushToTeam(B 組) → pushTeachers()
SK --> SC : 僅 B 組連線：本組已送出
SK -> MB : build()
SK --> TC : teacher:update {B 組 第 1 名、+3.2 秒、送出者、答案}
TC --> T : 看板顯示「目前最快：B 組」、1/4\n常駐提醒「請勿投影給學生」

== 結束（時間到 或 手動結束，只結束一次） ==
alt 倒數歸零
  FSM -> FSM : closeQuestion(TIME_UP)
else 老師提前結束
  T -> TC : 按「結束搶答」→ 確認視窗「確定結束」
  TC -> AR : POST /teacher/activity/close
  AR -> AS : closeQuestion(teacher)
  AS -> FSM : manualClose() → closeQuestion(MANUAL)
end
FSM -> FSM : 已非 ANSWERING 則直接回傳 false（冪等）
FSM -> AS : onQuestionClosed hook
AS -> RS : finalize(Q1, round, submissions, reason)
RS -> DB : 單一交易：作廢本題較早輪次 + 寫入 Submission / QuestionResult(winner=B, answers[], closedReason)
AS -> DB : ActivityEvent(QUESTION_CLOSED；時間到時 actor = null)
FSM -> DB : phase=CLOSED、Q1 status=CLOSED
FSM -> SK : onChange
SK --> TC : teacher:update {CLOSED, ResultBoard 依順位、未送出組}
SK --> SC : state:update（所有組答案依小題分列）

== 直接開放下一題（不經等待畫面） ==
TC --> T : 結果畫面已預選 Q2（下一個未開放題目）
note over SC : 學生持續看到 Q1 結果
T -> TC : 秒數 60、按「開始搶答」
TC -> AR : POST /teacher/activity/open {Q2, 60}
AR -> AS : openQuestion(teacher, Q2, 60)
AS -> FSM : open(Q2, 60)：CLOSED → ANSWERING
FSM -> SK : onChange
SK --> TC : teacher:update {ANSWERING Q2, monitor 0/4}
SK --> SC : state:update（Q1 結果 → Q2 作答）

== 重新開放已結束題目（選用） ==
T -> TC : 選 Q1、按「重新開放」→ 確認「會取代目前結果（B 組搶答成功）」
TC -> AR : POST /teacher/activity/reopen {Q1, seconds, confirm=true}
AR -> AS : reopenQuestion(teacher, Q1, 60, true)
AS -> AS : confirm 不為 true → 409 REOPEN_NOT_CONFIRMED
AS -> FSM : reopen(Q1, 60)
FSM -> AS : onQuestionOpened hook
AS -> SS : startQuestion(Q1, round=2, parts)
note right of DB : round 1 結果此時仍有效；新一輪結束時才在同一交易中作廢，\n因此伺服器在作答中重啟可恢復原結果
FSM -> DB : ANSWERING、Q1 currentRound=2
AS -> DB : ActivityEvent(QUESTION_REOPENED, 作廢結果摘要)
FSM -> SK : onChange
SK --> TC : teacher:update {ANSWERING Q1 第 2 輪, 0/4}
SK --> SC : state:update（各組可重新送出）

== 回到等待畫面（選用） ==
T -> TC : 按「回到等待畫面」
TC -> AR : POST /teacher/activity/back-to-waiting
AR -> AS : backToWaiting(teacher)
AS -> FSM : backToWaiting() → phase=WAITING
FSM -> SK : onChange
SK --> SC : state:update {WAITING}
@enduml
